# Plugin sidebar rules

When adding or changing a client plugin:

- Add a plugin-row hover tooltip that explains what the plugin does.
- Every setting needs a hover tooltip describing the option (RuneLite-style).
- Numeric settings (delays, draw distance, AA 2x/4x/6x, opacity, thresholds) must accept typed numbers with a documented max. Do not cycle-only.
- Colour settings must open a colour picker and store RGB. Do not cycle named colours only.
- Interactive chips/buttons must be high-contrast (light text, mid-grey fill, visible border).
- Cog icons must sit fully inside the row (not clipped).
- Window title stays the server name (`Soul-Trail`), never "Configuration" / panel names.
- Prefer infoboxes with an item/NPC icon plus a number over text-only overlays.
- Java 7 source: no lambdas, no diamond operator.
